<view class="page">
  <view class="page-head"><text class="page-title">资料变更</text><text class="page-description">提交姓名更正，并查看处理进度。调换部门请从部门调动入口申请。</text></view>
  <form bindsubmit="submit">
    <view class="card request-card">
      <text class="subtitle">姓名修改</text>
      <input class="field" name="name" placeholder="新姓名"/>
      <textarea class="field" name="reason" placeholder="说明变更原因"/>
      <button class="primary" form-type="submit" loading="{{busy}}">提交审核</button>
      <view class="info-strip"><t-icon name="info-circle" size="30rpx" /><text>手机号修改需要短信验证；微信换绑请使用新微信重新进入小程序并按提示验证手机号。</text></view>
    </view>
  </form>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">我的申请</text><text class="section-note">共 {{requests.length}} 项</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!requests.length}}" class="state-panel"><view class="state-icon"><t-icon name="file-paste" size="48rpx" /></view><text class="state-title">暂无变更申请</text><text class="state-copy">提交后可在此查看处理进度。</text></view>
  <view wx:else class="request-list">
    <view wx:for="{{requests}}" wx:key="id" class="request-row">
      <view class="request-copy"><text class="request-title">{{item.typeText}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.reviewNote || '等待管理员处理'}}</text></view>
      <view class="request-status"><text class="status">{{item.statusText}}</text><button wx:if="{{item.canWithdraw}}" size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="withdraw">撤回</button></view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<environment-badge />
